SUMMARY:Drop-In Public Tour
DESCRIPTION:Join volunteer educators or Museum staff for an interactive tour exploring the Museum’s history and Collection. Discovering Art in Asheville tours focus on a selection of objects showcasing both the Collection and current exhibitions. No two tours are the same. No reservations are required.
