SUMMARY:Adult Studio: Needle Felting
DESCRIPTION:Explore the natural qualities of pure wool roving and a simple handheld tool\, the barbed felting needle\, to lock fibers together into layered\, beautiful art pieces. Easy to learn\, impressive to show off\, incredibly soothing to create! This three-hour workshop is designed for beginners to wool craft\, but all experience levels are welcome.  \nJessica Kaufman earned her Masters degree in Craft Education\, and teaches a wide variety of workshops in fibers and textiles\, focusing mainly on dyeing\, surface design\, sewing\, and knitting. Her studio in Asheville is open to the public for classes and custom orders. Find info at www.waxonstudio.com.   \n REGISTER HERE
